  "visual_findings": [
    "Both grass variants retain bottom-rooted shapes on all six cards; neutral tint is supplied separately from the authored white albedo.",
    "Short blade thickness and sideways bend were fitted independently to avoid exaggerated curling on the low, wide cards.",
    "Continuous bark removes the earlier endgrain patch from standing-tree and small-tree surfaces.",
    "The separate stump atlas maps the cut to the upward island. The earlier cap patch targeted the underside.",
    "The original full imported beech model and imported collider are excluded from appearance-stage promotion.",
    "Original bark alpha behavior, actual lighting, normals and material-specific runtime integration remain open."
  ]
